  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c48f655d92fd4db296dc049bfbb1ede, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Cybersecurity Institute: This institute is committed to protecting
    the nation\u2019s digital infrastructure by advancing cybersecurity technologies
    and practices. Its mission covers developing tools for cyber threat detection
    and prevention, conducting research on cryptography and secure communications,
    and training cybersecurity professionals. Key focus areas include building AI-driven
    cybersecurity systems (to detect network intrusions or malware), working on critical
    infrastructure protection (power grids, oil facilities) against cyber attacks,
    and developing local encryption solutions and security protocols compliant with
    global standards. The institute collaborates with government agencies to test
    and strengthen the security of national networks and to respond to emerging cyber
    threats. It aims to make Saudi Arabia a leader in cybersecurity readiness and
    innovation, safeguarding the digital economy and national security"
